265
00:14:05,386 --> 00:14:06,470
- Oh.
- Mm!

266
00:14:06,554 --> 00:14:08,514
Looks like you've had quite a few.

267
00:14:08,597 --> 00:14:09,473
Not really.

268
00:14:09,557 --> 00:14:11,433
Have you ordered? What do you want?

269
00:14:11,517 --> 00:14:13,394
Oh, nothing. I'm fine.

270
00:14:13,477 --> 00:14:14,979
I'll just have whatever you're having.

271
00:14:15,062 --> 00:14:17,773
I'm sorry for bothering you. Just…

272
00:14:17,856 --> 00:14:20,568
There's something I wanted
to tell you face-to-face.

273
00:14:20,651 --> 00:14:21,986
What is it?

274
00:14:22,695 --> 00:14:25,573
Precious, these past few weeks,

275
00:14:28,033 --> 00:14:30,202
I've grown closer to you.

276
00:14:30,286 --> 00:14:31,620
- Mmm?
- Uh…

277
00:14:33,038 --> 00:14:35,332
I've seen what a kind person you are.

278
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:36,959
Um…

279
00:14:37,042 --> 00:14:39,837
I've seen how much you love the children…

280
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:41,797
- Your children.
- Mm-hmm.

281
00:14:43,173 --> 00:14:48,345
And I realized that
you need to know the truth.

282
00:14:48,429 --> 00:14:49,722
Precious,

283
00:14:49,805 --> 00:14:51,974
there's something I need to confess.

284
00:14:55,853 --> 00:14:57,146
I'm torn.

285
00:14:57,229 --> 00:14:59,398
I don't know if I should tell you.

286
00:15:00,024 --> 00:15:01,609
I'm afraid you'll get angry.

287
00:15:01,692 --> 00:15:05,070
I won't get angry.
What is it you want to tell me?

288
00:15:06,155 --> 00:15:07,489
[VOICE BREAKING] Precious…

289
00:15:10,326 --> 00:15:11,452
I'm sorry.

290
00:15:14,204 --> 00:15:16,540
But the truth is…

291
00:15:16,624 --> 00:15:18,208
I love you too.

292
00:15:19,126 --> 00:15:22,004
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

293
00:15:22,087 --> 00:15:23,923
Are we good? Okay?

294
00:15:25,883 --> 00:15:26,967
Okay.

295
00:15:30,512 --> 00:15:31,388
Uh…

296
00:15:31,472 --> 00:15:33,807
Waiter? Uh…

297
00:15:34,516 --> 00:15:36,810
One… one beer for her, please.

298
00:15:38,729 --> 00:15:44,151
[ROMANTIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

299
00:15:44,234 --> 00:15:45,361
[MUSIC STOPS]

300
00:15:45,444 --> 00:15:47,655
["TRAFFIC" PLAYING]

301
00:15:47,738 --> 00:15:52,117
<i>♪ It's such a waste of time</i>
<i>Being stuck in traffic ♪</i>

302
00:15:52,952 --> 00:15:55,788
<i>♪ It's so damn frustrating ♪</i>

303
00:15:56,747 --> 00:16:00,668
<i>♪ What if this never happens again? ♪</i>

304
00:16:02,378 --> 00:16:06,131
<i>♪ My body aches from sitting for hours ♪</i>

305
00:16:07,925 --> 00:16:10,219
<i>♪ I'm starting to hesitate ♪</i>

306
00:16:11,845 --> 00:16:15,432
<i>♪ What if you suddenly go home? ♪</i>

307
00:16:16,183 --> 00:16:20,104
<i>♪ Baby, I'm sorry, I'm still dreaming ♪</i>

308
00:16:20,187 --> 00:16:23,774
<i>♪ I can't blame this on anyone ♪</i>

309
00:16:23,857 --> 00:16:27,194
<i>♪ If only I could fly over EDSA ♪</i>

310
00:16:27,277 --> 00:16:29,989
<i>♪ Then I wouldn't have to wait ♪</i>

311
00:16:30,072 --> 00:16:31,824
<i>♪ Why is it like that? ♪</i>

312
00:16:33,826 --> 00:16:38,956
<i>♪ So many are rushing to get ahead ♪</i>

313
00:16:39,707 --> 00:16:40,791
Hey!

314
00:16:40,874 --> 00:16:46,130
<i>♪ Why does it feel so far</i>
<i>When you're right there? ♪</i>

315
00:16:46,714 --> 00:16:53,637
<i>♪ I'm afraid I won't catch up</i>
<i>If the world stops ♪</i>

316
00:16:54,346 --> 00:17:00,728
<i>♪ I'm willing to try</i>
<i>Even if I get stuck in traffic ♪</i>

317
00:17:02,479 --> 00:17:06,567
