373
00:20:45,953 --> 00:20:49,748
<i>It's Sir Eric.</i>
<i>Your aunt is dating Sir Eric.</i>

374
00:20:49,831 --> 00:20:50,874
<i>- Cute.</i>
<i>- Hmm.</i>

375
00:20:50,958 --> 00:20:53,794
<i>Why didn't Auntie Pres tell us</i>
<i>that she was dating Sir Eric?</i>

376
00:20:54,378 --> 00:20:56,463
<i>Maybe she's still shy about it.</i>

377
00:20:56,546 --> 00:20:59,424
<i>Well, if they're really dating,</i>

378
00:21:01,093 --> 00:21:02,636
<i>I hope we can meet him.</i>

379
00:21:02,719 --> 00:21:05,681
<i>- Surprise!</i>
<i>- Surprise!</i>

380
00:21:05,764 --> 00:21:08,684
[PRECIOUS CHUCKLING]
<i>Billy!</i>

381
00:21:13,230 --> 00:21:16,608
<i>You even made a fool of the person</i>
<i>who raised us and cared for us</i>

382
00:21:16,692 --> 00:21:18,235
<i>when that should have been you?!</i>
